~ start
do SignalManager.cutscene_started.emit()
Amelia: What was that in the corner?? Those shadows are [shake rate=20 level=10]moving![/shake]
Theodore: Don't worry Amelia, you can stand under my un-bearella. Just keep walking. Is there another breaker?
Amelia: Yeah, there's one in the kitchen.
Theodore: Then let's make our way there. I'm sure you can bear it. 
do SignalManager.cutscene_ended.emit()
do GameManager.living_room_intro = true
do SignalManager.activate_enemy_spawner.emit()

do SignalManager.dialogue_ended.emit()
=> END